  "description": "AbpGateway: one origin in front of an ABP site's servers and its web app, on YARP. It only routes: the server's paths to the servers (several, checked for readiness, or every address a name resolves to), every other path to the web. An MCP session stays on the server that started it; uploads aren't limited here; server-sent events may stay quiet for 30 minutes. It sets HSTS, nosniff, a referrer policy and a content security policy, and believes X-Forwarded-For only from trusted proxies.",
